message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the Data Descriptor article (preferred-citation) and the versioned Zenodo dataset record."
title: "miRBioGenAtlas: Sample-level multi-modal somatic alteration landscape of the miRNA biogenesis machinery across 32 TCGA cancer studies"
abstract: "Frozen, SHA-256-verified sample-level and aggregated multi-omic alteration resource for 15 miRNA biogenesis and regulatory genes across 32 TCGA PanCancer Atlas (2018) studies (33 cancer types; N = 10,195 tumours; 152,925 sample x gene records), with portable Python and R pipelines."
